## DR Architecture

### Regional Setup

| Region | Role | Services |
|--------|------|----------|
| us-east-1 | Primary | Full production stack |
| us-west-2 | Secondary/DR | Hot standby, replicated |
| eu-west-1 | Tertiary | Warm standby |

### Data Replication

| Data Type | Method | Lag | Location |
|-----------|--------|-----|----------|
| Database | Aurora Global | < 1 sec | us-west-2 |
| Object Storage | S3 Cross-Region | < 15 min | us-west-2 |
| Config/Secrets | Vault Replication | Real-time | us-west-2 |
| Backups | Cross-Region Copy | 1 hour | us-west-2, eu-west-1 |

### Infrastructure as Code

| Component | Repository | Recovery Method |
|-----------|------------|-----------------|
| AWS Resources | terraform-infra | Terraform apply |
| Kubernetes | k8s-manifests | ArgoCD sync |
| Application | docker-images | ECR pull |
| Configuration | config-repo | GitOps |

