## Disaster Scenarios

### Scenario Matrix

| Scenario | Likelihood | Impact | Response |
|----------|------------|--------|----------|
| Region Failure | Low | Critical | Full failover |
| AZ Failure | Medium | High | Auto-failover |
| Database Failure | Low | Critical | Promote replica |
| Network Outage | Medium | High | DNS failover |
| Cyber Attack | Low | Critical | IR + failover |
| Data Corruption | Low | Critical | PITR |
| Building Loss | Very Low | Medium | Remote work |

### Response by Scenario

| Scenario | RTO Target | Steps |
|----------|------------|-------|
| AZ Failure | 5 min | Automatic, multi-AZ |
| Region Failure | 2 hours | DR failover procedure |
| Database Corruption | 1 hour | Point-in-time recovery |
| Ransomware | 4 hours | Clean restore |
| Total Loss | 4 hours | Full DR activation |

