## Data Recovery

### Backup Schedule

| Data Type | Frequency | Retention | Location |
|-----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Database Full | Daily | 35 days | S3, cross-region |
| Database Incremental | 15 min | 7 days | Aurora |
| Transaction Logs | Continuous | 7 days | Aurora |
| Object Storage | Continuous | 90 days | S3, cross-region |
| Configuration | On change | Unlimited | Git |

### Recovery Procedures

| Scenario | Procedure | RTO |
|----------|-----------|-----|
| Single table | PITR restore | 30 min |
| Full database | Clone from backup | 2 hours |
| Point-in-time | Aurora PITR | 1 hour |
| Object restore | S3 versioning | 15 min |
| Config restore | Git checkout | 5 min |

### Data Validation

| Check | Method | Frequency |
|-------|--------|-----------|
| Backup integrity | Checksum verification | Daily |
| Restore test | Automated restore | Weekly |
| Full recovery test | Complete restore | Monthly |
| Cross-region sync | Lag monitoring | Continuous |

